# Compose in Neovim: the recipient completes from the people the Accounts
# have mail from, best first, as it is typed.
Output landing/public/media/compose.mp4
Output landing/public/media/compose.webm
Source demo/tapes/setup.tape

Show
Sleep 600ms
Type "c"
Sleep 1.2s
Type "A"
Set TypingSpeed 260ms
Type "Ma"
Sleep 1.2s
Ctrl+N
Sleep 500ms
Ctrl+N
Sleep 700ms
Ctrl+Y
Sleep 600ms
Escape
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Type "jjASlides for the demo"
Escape
Type "oAttach: Documents/se"
Sleep 900ms
Ctrl+N
Sleep 500ms
Ctrl+Y
Sleep 2s
